&lt;p&gt;To support search and rescue operations, various types of robots are deployed. Among them, &lt;strong&gt;snake robots&lt;/strong&gt; are particularly effective for locating victims trapped beneath debris after earthquakes. Their flexible structure allows them to navigate through narrow, unstable spaces where conventional robots cannot operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These robots autonomously traverse debris fields, detect survivors, and transmit their location to rescuers, significantly improving the speed and safety of rescue efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- Ring of Fire: Japan, Indonesia, New Zealand and 13 other counties are affected every year due seismic activity. As a result, urban areas are severely affected during natural disaster.
To support search and rescue operation various types of robots are deployed. Among them, snake robot is a specially designed SAR robot used for finding victims under earthquake debries. The robot has to traverse inside the debries in search of victims and transmit their location to rescuiers autonomously. --&gt;
&lt;h2 id="key-features"&gt;Key Features:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built-in battery pack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Untethred system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports hot-swap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-board computation unit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision driven system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconfigurable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="engineering-challenge"&gt;Engineering Challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the weight-to-power ratio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a reliable map using VSLAM during sudden falls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensor fusion for accurate robot state estimation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing an ML model for victim detection in low-light conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable data transmission within debris-filled environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
