&lt;p&gt;Here, a camera module is used to capture human actions then passed to pose estimation model for skleton extraction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A CNN image classification model clasifies the skeleton image and predicts the corresponding class. Each class has a predefined action sequence which is transmitted to the robot controller using ROS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The image processing happens in laptop using Python and Robot motion uses C++ runing in custom arduino board. The physical connection is established using USB cable and soft link using ROS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="motion-control-using-dl"&gt;Motion Control using DL&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;
&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/UsmOGdB1qRQ?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;t&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="key-features"&gt;Key Features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to control complex motion with simple actions (guesture) with high precision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 motions can be controlled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="major-challenges"&gt;Major Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop uses ROS Noetic; Arduno board uses ROS Melodic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
